$813E c CallScreen ; Call the routine A of ScreenTable $D000 with SP at $D000 and the sound off after
> The CALL at $8153 is patched to $D000 + 3 A. The screens draw full pages; the dashboard comes back with DashboardRestore.
$8150 CallScreenSetCallScreenCall1
