$964D c SoundArmSweep ; The step into SoundSweep, SoundMode 1, the first pass at once
$9657 c SoundArmHit ; Arm the player hit: noise from the ROM at $1A1A, 1 pass
$965E c SoundArmShipHit ; Arm a ship hit: noise from the ROM at $031A, 1 pass (k2: 15 runs from frame 3187)
$9663 c SoundArmNoise ; The instruction patched in, SoundSource = A * 256 + $1A ($1A1A or $031A), SoundMode 2, the first pulses at once
$9674 c SoundArmMissile ; Arm the missile's launch: pulses stepping by $E4 a pass (k2: 1 run, frame 2542)
$9678 SoundArmBomb ; the energy bomb: pulses stepping by $FE
$967A SoundArmPulses8
