$96A9 c SoundArmArrive ; Arm SoundArrive: 192 levels, the step $F0, pitch $C0, 12 passes
$96AF SoundArmScene ; SoundMode 3 with the interrupts off
$96B7 c SoundArmJump ; Arm SoundJump: 192 levels, the step $10, pitch $10, 10 passes
