$9E73 c Normalise ; Make a position vector (IX) a unit one: its length (SquareRoot of the sum of squares) and each part divided by it
$9E98 c SquareComponent ; The square of one 16-bit part (sign bit off) through the squares table: HL low, IX high, IX += 2
> (256 b + c)² = 65536 b² + 512 b c + c²: b c by Multiply8 $AB34, b² and c² from the table at $BE00 (low bytes) and $BF00 (high bytes).
$9EC7 SquareComponentDone
$9ECF c DivideComponent ; One part divided by the length (DE), halved, its sign put back
