$D7C3 w TokenControls 7 ; The standard set's 14 control codes: 0 nothing, 1 the galaxy's number, 2 the current system, 3 the selected system, 4 the commander, 5 the fuel, 6 capitals, 7 the cash, 8 sentence case, 9 a new line, 10 the other set on, 11 the galaxy's first system, 12 and 13 nothing
$D7DF w OtherControls 8 ; The other set's 32: 0 nothing, 1 capitals, 2 sentence case, 3 the selected system, 4 the commander, 5 and 6 the other set on and off, 7 a beep, 8 tab, 9 a clear page, 10 the column 0, 11 the rule, 12 a new line, 13 capital then small, 14 and 15 the justified text, 16 the galaxy's first system, 17 the system's people (-ian), 18 a random name, 19 a capital next, 21 the text area cleared, 22 and 24 waits, 23 and 29 rows 10 and 6, 25 a wait
