$E6FA c FirearmsPrice ; The firearms' price back to 70.4 Cr ($02C0 tenths) when ZeroFirearms cleared it
$E707 BuyCargoPage ; UNIT QUANTITY PRODUCT UNIT PRICE FOR SALE (code $FF), then each commodity in stock with its prompt
